tcrhex bundles material derived from third-party work:

1. inst/extdata/tcrdist_vloops_human.tsv (V-gene CDR1 / CDR2 / CDR2.5 loops)
   is derived from tcrdist3's tcrdist/db/alphabeta_gammadelta_db.tsv, and
   src/tcrdist.cpp ports pwseqdist's nb_vector_tcrdist (used by tcrdist3).

